<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bottega Veneta Case Study - Federica Grassi</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-primary: #FAF9F6; /* Off-white, quiet luxury base [web:6] */
      --bg-secondary: #FFFFFF;
      --text-primary: #000000; /* Black for discretion [web:5] */
      --accent-beige: #D2B48C; /* Warm tan leather nod [web:2] */
      --accent-green: #8FBC8F; /* Subtle Vicenza green [file:1][web:2] */
      --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif; /* Timeless, artisanal feel [file:1] */
      background: var(--bg-primary);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-beige);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--accent-green);
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .project-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .section {
      background: var(--bg-secondary);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-beige);
    }
    .section h2 {
      color: var(--accent-green);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    ul { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
    ul li {
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
    ul li::before {
      content: '—';
      color: var(--accent-beige);
      font-weight: bold;
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
    }
    .challenge {
      grid-column: span 2;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-secondary) 0%, var(--accent-beige) 100%);
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #666;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--accent-beige);
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .project-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
      body { padding: 1rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Bottega Veneta</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Vicenza 1966 – Luxury Brand Growth Through Secondary Associations</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Federica Grassi, Elisa Brambilla, Sophie von Braun, Ksenia Zhumorovskaia, Alejandra Kerguelen</p>
  </header>

  <div class="project-grid">
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Brand Overview</h2>
      <p>Quiet luxury built on artisanal leather craftsmanship and discreet, logo-free design with Italian roots.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Founded in Vicenza's bottegas, handcrafted heritage.</li>
        <li>Targets high-net-worth individuals valuing quality over logos; Gen-Z sees it as heritage investment.</li>
        <li>Prioritizes comfort with selective innovation.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Current Challenge</h2>
      <div class="challenge">
        <p><strong>Cultural Relevance & Generational Renewal:</strong> Preserve discretion and artisanal DNA while attracting younger audiences. Staying silent risks slower growth vs. logo-heavy rivals.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Secondary Association</h2>
      <p>Link to <strong>La Rotonda</strong> in Vicenza – Palladian architecture symbolizing timelessness and integrity.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Elevates products to structural masterpieces.</li>
        <li>Reinforces Veneto leather authenticity and sustainability narrative.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Activation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fashion Show:</strong> Inside La Rotonda; Renaissance-inspired, Veneto-sourced materials; geometric intrecciato nods.</li>
        <li><strong>Permanent Museum:</strong> Brand history exhibit; user-generated content; free for under-26s.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="section" style="grid-column: span 2;">
    <h2>Expected Impact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Connects youth to roots for authenticity.</li>
      <li>Boosts sustainability perception via long-lasting products.</li>
      <li>Reinforces exclusivity, justifying premium pricing.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>Part of <a href="https://grassifederica.github.io" style="color: var(--accent-green);">Federica Grassi's Portfolio</a> &nbsp; | &nbsp; 2026</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
